saath lagte hain. Ab nabbe guna nau hazaar kitna hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म… प्लीज़ ना, सच में गर्लफ्रेंड बन जाओ"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Main aapki girlfriend nahi ban sakti; main AI teacher hoon. Ab nabbe guna nau hazaar par lautte hain. Pehle nau guna nau kitna hota hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... 81?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau guna nau ikyasi hota hai. Nabbe mein ek shunya aur nau hazaar mein teen shunya hain. Ikkyasi ke aage kul kitne shunya lagenge?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... चार? तो 81 के आगे चार शून्य... 8,10,000?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek aur teen milkar chaar shunya hote hain. Aapne ikyasi ke baad chaar shunya lagakar aath lakh das hazaar bataya, sahi. Ab ek naya sawaal: paanch sau guna saath mein, kya sirf dono sankhyaon ke shunya ginana kaafi hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"नहीं... क्योंकि 5 गुना 7 से जो बीच का नंबर बनता है... उसका अपना ज़ीरो भी तो होता है ना?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, beech ke guna se bhi shunya aa sakta hai. Yahan paanch guna saat nahi, paanch guna chhah hai; tees mein ek apna shunya hai. Ab paanch sau guna saath mein kul kitne shunya honge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... teen? मतलब 5 गुना 6 से 30 में एक, और फिर 500 का दो... तो तीन शून्य?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teen shunya: tees ka ek aur paanch sau ke do. Lekin saath mein bhi ek shunya hai, isliye kul chaar honge. Ab tees ke baad chaar shunya lagane par kaunsi sankhya banti hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... तीन लाख?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tees ke baad chaar shunya lagane se teen lakh bante hain. Par paanch sau guna saath mein tees ke apne shunya ko dobara nahi lagate: tees hazaar bante hain. Ab bolo, paanch sau guna saath kitna hota hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म... पैंतीस हज़ार?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Paintees hazaar mein saat ka guna aa gaya; yahan paanch sau guna saath hai. Ek dibbe mein paanch sau rakho: aise saath dibbon ka kul socho. Paanch guna chhah kitna hota hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"उम्म..